  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of national capacity-building to promote girls&apos; right to education in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to support the government&apos;s efforts in increasing access and improving quality of girls&apos; education through capacity building and targeted interventions at both institutional and community level. The current project with an overarching role for all the ongoing 9 projects of Girls Right to Education Programme (GREP) in Pakistan, will also focus on cross cutting issues common across all the provinces, while facilitating the regular interventions of each individual project.</narrative>
  </description>
